  🗃 A directory of static files, to mount under a prefix:

    🗃 app 🔤/assets🔤 ⏳ 🆕🗃 🔤public🔤❗️ 3600❗️❗️

  A path under the prefix is answered with the file it names, a directory
  with its index.html, and anything that is hidden or would lead out of the
  directory with a 404: the name is looked for the way 📬🐇📁 looks for a name
  from a client. Every setter returns the directory.
